📝 Notes & Reflections
Key Takeaways
Linux filesystem is a single tree; know the purpose of each top‑level directory.

find + grep + xargs is a powerful combination for automation.

Always test sed/awk on a copy before using -i.

man is your best friend — use man <command>.

